### Health check
GET http://localhost:5003/health

### OpenAPI spec
GET http://localhost:5003/api-docs.json

### Register
POST http://localhost:5003/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5003/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Refresh tokens
POST http://localhost:5003/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:5003/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:5003/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List completed tasks
GET http://localhost:5003/tasks?completed=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create task
POST http://localhost:5003/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Finish TaskFlow API",
  "description": "Polish and deploy",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Get task by ID
GET http://localhost:5003/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:5003/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "LOW"
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:5003/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
